        "Berserk (Ex)",
        "A quadricorn that takes damage in combat goes berserk on its next turn, attacking madly until either it or its opponent is dead. It gains a +2 bonus on melee attack rolls, melee damage rolls, and Will saving throws but takes a -2 penalty to its Armor Class. It also gains 2 temporary hit points per Hit Die, which is 20 temporary hit points for most quadricorns. In addition, the quadricorn gains the pounce ability. The quadricorn cannot end its berserk state voluntarily.",
